## Phase 2 Contribution

This issue **defines** Phase 2: Empty World by literally making the world empty.

> "The canvas must be blank before systems paint on it"

Without this deletion:
- Ambush spawns compete with static monsters
- Travelers blend into existing NPCs
- Treasure chests lost among clutter

With this deletion:
- Every creature you see is from ambush system (dynamic)
- Every NPC you meet is a traveler (ephemeral)
- Every chest spawned just for you (treasure system)

The systems become visible and meaningful. The empty world is the stage for their performance.
